# Mana is produced by the source of the ability that adds it (CR 106.3), whatever paid that ability's cost: on turn 5 Barracks
# of the Thousand's {W} pays Crystal Grotto's "{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color", and the Grotto's {W} casts Healer's Hawk.
# No mana the Barracks produced was spent to cast the Hawk (its {W} was spent on the Grotto's ability), so there is no new Gnome
# Soldier.

